    "summary": "Bearer: an **EMPEROR’S CHILDREN** or **KEEPER OF SECRETS** model.\n\nWhenever it makes an **[advance move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move)**, the bearer's unit skips its Advance roll; its models get +6\" M instead, for the rest of the phase.\n\nWhenever they make a **[normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move)**, **[advance move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move)** or **[fall-back move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back)**, models of the bearer's unit can pass through enemy models. While doing so, a model can enter [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) of those enemy models but cannot end the move there, and passes any **[Desperate Escape test](vsdata:core-rule/desperate-escape)** automatically.",
